{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09494","headline":"凌雾行 · 韦应物","name":"凌雾行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋城海雾重，职事凌晨出。\n浩浩合元天，溶溶迷朗日。\n才看含鬓白，稍视沾衣密。\n道骑全不分，郊树都如失。\n霏微误嘘吸，肤腠生寒栗。\n归当饮一杯，庶用蠲斯疾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}